Windows split tunneling driver
------------------------------
The Windows build of Nimbus can use the split tunnel driver from the Mullvad
VPN app, https://github.com/mullvad/win-split-tunnel, which is Copyright (C)
Mullvad VPN AB and distributed under GPL-3.0. It is used unmodified and only as
a separately installed driver; the source is available at the URL above, as
GPL-3.0 requires. Nimbus is not affiliated with or endorsed by Mullvad.

Nimbus never writes or signs its own kernel driver: Windows only loads drivers
signed by Microsoft, so reusing an existing signed GPL driver is the only way to
offer per-application exclusion without an EV code-signing certificate.
